00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.710
It's going to work.

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.979
We already use it in a lot of test cases
and stuff like that, so we're a supporter.

00:12:18.979 --> 00:12:22.543
I do worry a little bit about
the security because, like I said,

00:12:22.543 --> 00:12:27.435
we move $6 trillion a day, real time,
