00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:36.020
There are three cryptocurrencies, okay,
three types, three separate types.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:41.050
One is ICOs, ICO and I haven't studied
these things, but you're paying for

00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:45.755
